<h2 id="the-defer-keyword">The defer Keyword</h2>

<p>In Swift, there’s a keyword very similar to <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">finally</code> in try-catch-finally. After a code block completes execution, it executes final cleanup code to finish some teardown work.</p>

<p>For example:</p>

<p>Cleanup work, resource reclamation.
Similar to the example in the Swift documentation, a great use case for defer is cleanup work. File operations are a perfect example:
Closing files.</p>

