<h4 id="simple-understanding">Simple Understanding</h4>

<p>You can simply think of the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">defer</code> keyword as the last function to call before return. Whether it’s a switch or other condition causing the function to return, if we want to do some cleanup before return, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">defer</code> is a perfect fit.</p>

